      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is complex to categorize all opposition as purely misinformation; some concerns stem from philosophical objections to government power. However, it is also true that a significant portion of the resistance has been fueled by scientifically unsupported claims. A balanced framing acknowledges both well-founded concerns about rights and the impact of misinformation on public discourse. Therefore, recognizing both the validity of the liberty debate and the influence of false information is key.",
