    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that, but if we're looking at it from a policy standpoint, doesn't the reality of the scientific consensus make the 'liberty' argument kinda secondary? i mean, if the science is settled, isn't staying neutral on the mandate debate basically just giving equal weight to something that isn't actually true?",
